[
  {
    "id": "rec53Sqa3ByQybZxs",
    "text": "It’s Baltimore, gentlemen. The gods will not save you.",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "attribution": "Ervin Burrell",
    "source": "The Wire",
    "album": "",
    "year": null,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "1438",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "S3.E3 — Dead Soldiers",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "rec7HYPVvZOfkydHd",
    "text": "You know what I was thinking? That tonight’s a good night. Why? Because my shot cop didn’t die. Then it hit me. This is what makes a good night on my watch. Absence of a negative.",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "attribution": "Bunny Colvin",
    "source": "The Wire",
    "album": "",
    "year": null,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "1438",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "S3.E2 — All Due Respect",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "rec7RvhDvXhDBJIoA",
    "text": "See, the thing is, you only got to fuck up once. Be a little slow, be a little late, just once. And how you ain't gonna never be slow, never be late? You can't plan for no shit like this, man. It's life.",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "attribution": "Avon Barksdale",
    "source": "The Wire",
    "album": "",
    "year": null,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "1438",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "Season 1, Episode 5, The Pager",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "rec8EoapMleW1lR8v",
    "text": "We ain't nothin' but mammals\nWell, some of us cannibals who cut other people open like cantaloupes.",
    "type": "lyric",
    "attribution": "Eminem",
    "source": "The Real Slim Shady",
    "album": "The Marshall Mathers LP",
    "year": 2000,
    "genius_id": "531",
    "tmdb_id": "",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "rec97w20wD77GO2KU",
    "text": "I switched my motto; instead of sayin', \"Fuck tomorrow!\"\nThat buck that bought a bottle could've struck the lotto.",
    "type": "lyric",
    "attribution": "Nas",
    "source": "Life’s a Bitch",
    "album": "Illmatic",
    "year": 1994,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "rec9jEycYltYVhF8a",
    "text": "There's a war goin' on outside, no man is safe from\nYou could run, but you can't hide forever\nFrom these streets that we done took.",
    "type": "lyric",
    "attribution": "Mobb Deep",
    "source": "Survival of the Fittest",
    "album": "The Infamous",
    "year": null,
    "genius_id": "19690872",
    "tmdb_id": "",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recAGv7jebWDRF9X8",
    "text": "A broad brush is going to miss the details.",
    "type": "quote",
    "attribution": "",
    "source": "",
    "album": "",
    "year": null,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recAjIJZFzP9UzNYx",
    "text": "Not my clowns, not my circus.",
    "type": "quote",
    "attribution": "",
    "source": "",
    "album": "",
    "year": null,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recAmUCJ3Wesz6Oi6",
    "text": "Stay gold.",
    "type": "passage",
    "attribution": "S.E. Hinton",
    "source": "The Outsiders",
    "album": "",
    "year": 1983,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recBjSz0mbIZFaIHk",
    "text": "The fish don't care when it rains.",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "attribution": "Jennifer Msumba",
    "source": "The Fish Don't Care When It Rains",
    "album": "",
    "year": null,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "1748069",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recCKJUt5ctKHw1dP",
    "text": "What they need is a union.",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "attribution": "Beadie Russell",
    "source": "The Wire",
    "album": "",
    "year": null,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "1438",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "S2.E3 — Hot Shots",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recDjbfOgdjbwG4vz",
    "text": "Is you taking notes on a criminal fucking conspiracy?",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "attribution": "Stringer Bell",
    "source": "The Wire",
    "album": "",
    "year": null,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "1438",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "S3.E5 — Straight and True",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recEhSRdVvQtz6g5k",
    "text": "Never pick a fight with someone who buys ink by the barrel.",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "attribution": "Daniel Phelan",
    "source": "The Wire",
    "album": "",
    "year": null,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "1438",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "S5.E6 — The Dickensian Aspect",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recGQTBCoVpjVOMy5",
    "text": "I'm mouthwash, 'cause if I was on the floor, I'd swish (Fluoride, fluoride, swish).",
    "type": "lyric",
    "attribution": "Eminem",
    "source": "The Adventures of Moon Man & Slim Shady",
    "album": "The Adventures of Moon Man & Slim Shady",
    "year": 2020,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recIneanqXnJjdYde",
    "text": "You know what the most dangerous thing in America is, right? Nigga with a library card.",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "attribution": "Brother Mouzone",
    "source": "The Wire",
    "album": "",
    "year": null,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "1438",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "Season 2, Episode 10, Storm Warnings",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recInkXlujcuPHfk8",
    "text": "Some birds aren't meant to be caged.",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "attribution": "Red",
    "source": "The Shawshank Redemption",
    "album": "",
    "year": 1994,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "278",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recJTryaQehxbSuVa",
    "text": "It gets easier. Every day it gets a little easier. But you gotta do it every day —that’s the hard part. But it does get easier.",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "attribution": "BoJack Horsman",
    "source": "BoJack Horseman",
    "album": "",
    "year": 2015,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recJlPPRGcvkMurDw",
    "text": "My skin is my sin, look at my complexion.",
    "type": "lyric",
    "attribution": "Ice Cube",
    "source": "My Skin is My Sin",
    "album": "Bootlegs & B-Sides",
    "year": 1994,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recJqznM5EMtJFWZj",
    "text": "You can't change the people around you, but you can change the people around you.",
    "type": "quote",
    "attribution": "",
    "source": "",
    "album": "",
    "year": null,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recM5moMtbp9wSYa4",
    "text": "One day, when it's safe, when there's no personal downside to calling a thing what it is, when it's too late to hold anyone accountable, everyone will have always been against this.",
    "type": "passage",
    "attribution": "Omar El Akkad",
    "source": "",
    "album": "",
    "year": 2025,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recMmzx0sYK2L3I0V",
    "text": "I never had any friends later on like the ones I had when I was twelve. Jesus, does anyone?",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "attribution": "Gordie Lachance",
    "source": "Stand By Me",
    "album": "",
    "year": 1986,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "235",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recPLBj32YttA9KyR",
    "text": "I'm gonna make him an offer he can't refuse.",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "attribution": "Vito Corleone",
    "source": "The Godfather",
    "album": "",
    "year": 1972,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "238",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recQFj9Za3fLXScrU",
    "text": "Ain’t no shame in holding on to grief, as long as you make room for other things too.",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "attribution": "Reginald ‘Bubbles’ Cousins",
    "source": "The Wire",
    "album": "",
    "year": null,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "1438",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "S5.E9 — Late Editions",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recQwDVr5j030TqPO",
    "text": "Everybody want to know what I would do if I didn't win... I guess we'll never know.",
    "type": "lyric",
    "attribution": "Kanye West",
    "source": "",
    "album": "",
    "year": 2005,
    "genius_id": "30824604",
    "tmdb_id": "",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recS8bBDB798Uqqoe",
    "text": "Lesson here, ‘Bey: You come at the king, you best not miss.",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "attribution": "Omar Little",
    "source": "The Wire",
    "album": "",
    "year": null,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "1438",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "S1.E8 — Lessons",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recT2pUTnUiKPDQFq",
    "text": "The fish,\nEven in the fisherman's net,\nStill carries,\nThe smell of the sea.",
    "type": "quote",
    "attribution": "Mourid Barghouti",
    "source": "",
    "album": "",
    "year": null,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "",
    "wiki_title": "Mourid Barghouti",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recTvMhZ8jWUmUbRp",
    "text": "Life moves pretty fast. If you don't stop and look around once in a while, you could miss it.",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "attribution": "Ferris Bueller",
    "source": "Ferris Bueller's Day Off",
    "album": "",
    "year": 1986,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recUJDW3Ex6bJD037",
    "text": "This too shall pass.",
    "type": "quote",
    "attribution": "این نیز بگذرد",
    "source": "",
    "album": "",
    "year": null,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/This_too_shall_pass",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recUcWLbbJKKqEDWi",
    "text": "Don’t believe we met. Proposition Joe. You ever steal from me, I’ll kill your whole family.",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "attribution": "Proposition Joe",
    "source": "The Wire",
    "album": "",
    "year": null,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "1438",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "S1.E10 — The Cost",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recV0PCekXra8Kbkh",
    "text": "The game is rigged, but you cannot lose if you do not play.",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "attribution": "Marla Daniels",
    "source": "The Wire",
    "album": "",
    "year": null,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "1438",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "S1.E2 — The Detail",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recVYF1tH6aj3KMws",
    "text": "Hello darkness, my old friend.",
    "type": "lyric",
    "attribution": "Simon & Garfunkel",
    "source": "The Sound of Silence",
    "album": "",
    "year": 1964,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recWdSCKvuDf5Ky0N",
    "text": "We ain’t gotta dream no more, man. We got real shit. Real estate we can touch.",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "attribution": "Stringer Bell",
    "source": "The Wire",
    "album": "",
    "year": null,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "1438",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "S3.E11 — Middle Ground",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recWygQR1PBMspX4s",
    "text": "But, uh—a thug changes, and love changes\nAnd best friends become strangers (Word up).",
    "type": "lyric",
    "attribution": "Nas",
    "source": "The Message",
    "album": "It Was Written",
    "year": null,
    "genius_id": "339159",
    "tmdb_id": "",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recajM8ajsk04LFiB",
    "text": "Man, money ain’t got no owners, only spenders.",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "attribution": "Omar Little",
    "source": "The Wire",
    "album": "",
    "year": null,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "1438",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "S4.E4 — Refugees",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recavzjg8N5Ss9nus",
    "text": "How did you know you could do that? I just never thought I couldn't.",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "attribution": "Lightning McQueen",
    "source": "Cars 3",
    "album": "",
    "year": 2017,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "260514",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "reccboRQLtf8tPAsg",
    "text": "Get busy living, or get busy dying.",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "attribution": "Red",
    "source": "The Shawshank Redemption",
    "album": "",
    "year": 1994,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "reccsHc9k1ylheUWE",
    "text": "You went full r*tard man, never go full r*tard.",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "attribution": "Kirk Lazarus",
    "source": "Tropic Thunder",
    "album": "",
    "year": 2008,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recdSOsTl5NR1hh7w",
    "text": "This game is rigged, man.",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "attribution": "Preston \"Bodie\" Broadus",
    "source": "The Wire",
    "album": "",
    "year": null,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "1438",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "Season 4, Episode 13, Final Grades",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recdsP4yd2CsPlPnX",
    "text": "We’re building something here, detective. We’re building it from scratch. All the pieces matter.",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "attribution": "Lester Freamon",
    "source": "The Wire",
    "album": "",
    "year": null,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "1438",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "S1.E6 — The Wire",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "rece4aaelhjy3WTvB",
    "text": "A person is smart. People are dumb.",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "attribution": "K",
    "source": "Men in Black",
    "album": "",
    "year": 1997,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recfcyNH6HRlf9khH",
    "text": "Just wakin' up in the mornin', gotta thank God.",
    "type": "lyric",
    "attribution": "Ice Cube",
    "source": "It Was a Good Day",
    "album": "",
    "year": 1992,
    "genius_id": "237",
    "tmdb_id": "",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recgjzNaKazKPedbB",
    "text": "“Failure to properly identify myself as a police officer.” Sounds like what I was guilty of most of my career, actually.",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "attribution": "Roland Pryzbylewski",
    "source": "The Wire",
    "album": "",
    "year": null,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "1438",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "S3.E12 — Mission Accomplished",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "reciVBDYCTPXxrrgI",
    "text": "Lights, camera, acting.",
    "type": "quote",
    "attribution": "",
    "source": "",
    "album": "",
    "year": null,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recjezTibNvE31UIq",
    "text": "But they all didn't see, the little bit of sadness in me.",
    "type": "lyric",
    "attribution": "Kid Cudi",
    "source": "Soundtrack 2 My Life",
    "album": "Man on the Moon: The End of Day",
    "year": 2009,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "reckKCaQRQIedMw65",
    "text": "If you’d wanted to do me, I’d already be done. But there ain’t nothing you fear more than a bad headline, is there? You’d rather live in shit than let the world see you work a shovel.",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "attribution": "Cedric Daniels",
    "source": "The Wire",
    "album": "",
    "year": null,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "1438",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "S1.E12 — Cleaning Up",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recmo2hGX3PSLsdSa",
    "text": "I only debate my equals, all others I teach.",
    "type": "quote",
    "attribution": "Dr. John Henrik",
    "source": "",
    "album": "",
    "year": null,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recnPxlX9XtHNiMjI",
    "text": "I'm not your friend right now. I'm raising and teaching you so that one day, I can be your friend.",
    "type": "quote",
    "attribution": "Deante' Kyle",
    "source": "",
    "album": "",
    "year": null,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recoyGriYffZdwR8O",
    "text": "It was a bright cold day in April, and the clocks were striking thirteen.",
    "type": "passage",
    "attribution": "George Orwell",
    "source": "1984",
    "album": "",
    "year": 1949,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "OL1168083W",
    "note": "",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recqGXQGfuwDgbt4z",
    "text": "You cannot heal in the same environment that made you sick.",
    "type": "quote",
    "attribution": "",
    "source": "",
    "album": "",
    "year": null,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recrXPgsxwHf40acR",
    "text": "You gonna help, huh? You gonna look out for me? You gonna look out for me, Sergeant Carver? You mean it? You gonna look out for me? You promise? You got my back, huh?",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "attribution": "Randy Wagstaff",
    "source": "The Wire",
    "album": "",
    "year": null,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "1438",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "S4.E12 — That’s Got His Own",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recrjv81E73h3nUh1",
    "text": "It ain’t what you takin’, it’s who you takin’ from, ya feel me? How you expect to run with the wolves come night when you spend all day sparring with the puppies?",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "attribution": "Omar Little",
    "source": "The Wire",
    "album": "",
    "year": null,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "1438",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "S4.E3 — Home Rooms",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recsCt33ZuSMYK2TY",
    "text": "Free to be radical. Radical enough to be free.",
    "type": "quote",
    "attribution": "",
    "source": "",
    "album": "",
    "year": null,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recsvXHdosYhE3dpq",
    "text": "I wish there was a way to know you’re in the good old days before you’ve actually left them.",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "attribution": "Andy Bernard",
    "source": "The Office",
    "album": "",
    "year": 2013,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "rectScSTc8FYvWWPK",
    "text": "Here I go, deep type flow\nJacques Cousteau could never get this low.",
    "type": "lyric",
    "attribution": "Wu-Tang Clan",
    "source": "Da Mystery of Chessboxin’",
    "album": "Enter the Wu-Tang (36 Chambers)",
    "year": null,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "rectpzGbuu7l3KFXY",
    "text": "Don't be incredible. Be incredulous.",
    "type": "quote",
    "attribution": "",
    "source": "",
    "album": "",
    "year": null,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recued1InbkQ529YU",
    "text": "Yeah, I ain't no suit-wearin' businessman like you. You know, I'm just a gangsta, I suppose. And I want my corners.",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "attribution": "Avon Barksdale",
    "source": "The Wire",
    "album": "",
    "year": null,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "1438",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "S3.E6 — Homecoming",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recvcIipvZjRV0gHk",
    "text": "Celebrities always seem much smaller when you meet them in person.",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "attribution": "Daniel Phelan",
    "source": "The Wire",
    "album": "",
    "year": null,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "1438",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "S1.E5 — The Pager",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recvrydmSBtaSIQom",
    "text": "Choose content over content.",
    "type": "quote",
    "attribution": "",
    "source": "",
    "album": "",
    "year": null,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recvyJYycFupCkpXp",
    "text": "No complaints.",
    "type": "quote",
    "attribution": "",
    "source": "",
    "album": "",
    "year": null,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "",
    "wiki_title": "",
    "openlibrary_id": "",
    "note": "",
    "skip": false
  },
  {
    "id": "recxPJb4MW98uhexs",
    "text": "This is the worst.",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "attribution": "Michael Scott",
    "source": "The Office",
    "album": "",
    "year": 2006,
    "genius_id": "",
    "tmdb_id": "",
